{"turn_id": "d06-t1", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_sources", "text": "The study plans to collect data on bipolar disorder and personal recovery from three sources: Twitter, Reddit (focusing on mental health-related content), and blogs authored by affected individuals.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "social_media_identification", "text": "Twitter and Reddit users with a BD diagnosis will be identified automatically via self-reported diagnosis statements, such as 'I was diagnosed with BD-I last week'.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "pattern_extension", "text": "To identify these users, the study will extend on the diagnosis patterns and terms for BD provided by prior work.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "blog_identification", "text": "Relevant blogs will be manually identified, and their authors will be contacted to obtain informed consent for using their texts.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "consent", "text": "Implicit consent is assumed from users on these platforms to use their public tweets and posts.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d06-t2", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_sources", "text": "研究计划从三个来源收集与双相障碍（BD）总体及个人康复相关的数据：Twitter、Reddit（与以往工作不同，聚焦心理健康相关内容）以及由受影响个体撰写的博客。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "twitter_reddit_identification", "text": "Twitter和Reddit上具有BD诊断的用户将通过自我报告的诊断陈述自动识别，例如“I was diagnosed with BD-I last week”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "diagnosis_patterns_extension", "text": "为实现上述识别，研究将在既有工作（BIBREF47）提供的BD诊断模式与术语基础上进行扩展。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "implicit_consent", "text": "对于Twitter和Reddit平台上的用户，假定其公共推文和帖子存在隐式同意（implicit consent）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "blog_identification_consent", "text": "相关博客将被人工识别，并联系其作者以获得使用其文本的知情同意（informed consent）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "previous_datasets_limitation", "text": "以往Twitter的BD数据集已无法用于后续研究；两个Reddit数据集中与心理健康相关的内容被有意移除，因此这些数据无法用于分析心理健康在网上的谈论方式。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-b8ed06d1898387a8a4083045"}]}, {"key": "project_aim", "text": "该跨学科项目将收集并分析被诊断为双相障碍个体的社交媒体数据，以考察其康复经历。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d06-t3", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bd_identification_social_media", "text": "在双相障碍论文中，双相障碍个体并非通过临床诊断流程在文中被重新识别，而是被界定为“被诊断为双相障碍”的个体，其社交媒体数据（第一人称在线叙述）将被收集和分析。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}]}, {"key": "bd_identification_criteria_question", "text": "该论文的研究问题之一是“符合双相障碍标准的个体如何在网上讨论个人康复”，即研究对象以是否符合BD标准来界定，但所给证据未说明具体采用何种筛选或识别程序。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-36b5890f191631d456e020a1"}]}, {"key": "bd_settings_comparison", "text": "该研究计划比较来自不同情境（结构化访谈与 informal 在线话语）以及不同背景的双相障碍个体的叙述，而非仅在结构化环境中收集数据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-86f9f7f681d7fac5268e9c9b"}]}, {"key": "bd_linguistic_features", "text": "双相障碍论文中所述的计算语言学方法旨在处理互联网上多种语言、族群多样人群的第一人称在线叙述，但所给证据未列出其具体采用的语言学特征清单。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}]}, {"key": "readable_participants", "text": "《A Readable Read》不涉及临床个体识别：其研究对象是瑞典第二语言（L2）教材中的文本（由教师和教材编写者撰写），目标是预测这些材料的语言复杂度而非评估学习者产出的文本。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-eaa4f5b0a34eef1ffc8a4b09"}]}, {"key": "readable_labels", "text": "该论文采用欧洲语言共同参考框架（CEFR）的熟练度等级作为分类目标，文档级覆盖A1–C2六级，句子级进行A1–C1的五类分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-eaa4f5b0a34eef1ffc8a4b09"}]}, {"key": "readable_feature_families", "text": "该论文的特征来自多个语言学维度，包括词频等词汇特征、长度类特征、语义特征和句法特征，并提到前人工作使用词性标注器和依存句法分析器以及Coh-Metrix式的认知动机特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-cbb7f9f0d9a80a8b97da806b"}]}, {"key": "readable_lexical_dominance", "text": "在文档级，仅使用词汇特征即可达到约0.8的F值，与完整特征集的0.81相近，说明词汇信息单独就能较好区分教材文本的CEFR等级；而在句子级，组合多种特征比仅用词汇特征提升约7%的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}]}, {"key": "readable_lix", "text": "该论文指出传统瑞典可读性指标LIX（结合平均句长与超过六个字符的长词比例）不适合此任务，其准确率很低且将91.6%的实例判为B2级。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-eaa4f5b0a34eef1ffc8a4b09"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}, {"key": "comparability_task", "text": "两篇论文的任务目标不同：一篇旨在分析双相障碍个体的在线个人康复叙述，另一篇旨在预测瑞典L2教材文本和句子的CEFR熟练度等级，因此就“如何识别个体”这一问题而言，后者不涉及个体识别。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-eaa4f5b0a34eef1ffc8a4b09"}]}, {"key": "comparability_evidence_limits", "text": "就可比性而言，所给证据只详细描述了《A Readable Read》的特征类别与结果，而双相障碍论文的证据未提供具体语言学特征清单，因此仅凭所给证据无法对两者的特征集进行逐项对比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1906.01010", "chunk_id": "c-8501c609aafc1a9ab4878246"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d06-t4", "session_id": "d06", "turn": 4, "answer": {"decision": "refuse", "claims": [], "text": "当前语料证据不足或请求超出论文库范围。"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d06-t4", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": true, "pipeline_success": true, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": null, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": false, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
